datory node-restart protocol is also complete and coherent: boot ID 9909e7e8-c083-4915-9e37-25fd616a539f was captured with a healthy pre-restart service and data state, restart scheduling was acknowledged, the boot ID changed to e77c6ff5-3f1d-43a2-8538-5e664da66745, and service, documents, authentication, CRUD, locking, firewall, and SELinux state recovered. Fixed lifecycle observations independently confirm the boot transition and recovered port-8080 listener.","limitations":["Some lock-related HTTP values were redacted in captured stdout. The successful command exits, explicit assertions, and preserved-content results still provide strong behavioral evidence.","The final source-tree check listed access.txt but did not recalculate its hash; the project document files themselves received baseline-relative hash and content comparisons."]}
